  "usage_note": "**Go to bed**, **be in bed**, **get out of bed**, and **time for bed** take no article because they are about sleeping or resting. With **the** or **a**, you mean the furniture: *She sat on the bed*; *We need a new bed*.",
  "learner_errors": [
    {
      "incorrect": "I go to the bed at ten o'clock.",
      "correct": "I go to bed at ten o'clock.",
      "note": "In **go to bed**, meaning go to sleep, there is no article."
    },
    {
      "incorrect": "Don't forget to do your bed.",
      "correct": "Don't forget to make your bed.",
      "note": "You **make** a bed when you put the covers in order."
    }
